---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PosterGallery from '../../components/PosterGallery.astro';
import JubileeHero from '../../components/JubileeHero.astro';
import JubileeBand from '../../components/JubileeBand.astro';
import { edition } from '../../data/edition';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`MASSKA ${edition.year} · ${edition.numeral} Anniversary International Theatre Review`}
  description={`${edition.numeral} MASSKA Anniversary International Theatre Review ${edition.year} in Sopot. 25 years of Masska: performances, workshops and meetings with the artists, live and online.`}
  lang="en"
  showPartners={true}
  redirectToPreferredLanguage={false}
>
        <JubileeHero lang="en" />
        <JubileeBand lang="en" />

        <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="introduction">
            <div class="section-inner intro">
                <div class="intro__side">
                    <h2 id="introduction">Masska – a quarter of a century for the human being</h2>
                    <p class="intro__byline"><span class="sr-only">Author: </span>Opening words · Paulina Lewandowska</p>
                    <p class="intro__quote" aria-hidden="true">Every person matters.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="intro__body">
                    <div id="opening-words" data-intro>
                        <p>Before we begin celebrating our anniversary, I would like to stop time for a moment. Let us look around. Let us look at one another. Because we are not meeting only to celebrate the festival's anniversary. We are meeting to honour something much greater. People. Their stories. Their courage. Their presence.</p>
                        <p>Twenty-five years ago Jacek believed it was worth creating a place where every person could step onto the stage and be heard. A place where a person would not be judged through the lens of their disability. A place where the most important thing would be that they simply are. And so a story was born that has now lasted a quarter of a century.</p>
                        <p>Over these 25 years far more has happened on that stage than thousands of theatre performances. Someone dared to step in front of an audience for the first time. Someone overcame their own fear. Someone felt that they matter. That they have a voice. Because for one person a performance may simply be a show. And that is exactly why MASSKA is so needed.</p>
                        <p>I want to remember the people who created this story. Those who came here over the years from different places, from different backgrounds, with different experiences. I also think of those who were once here with us, and whom we can no longer see today.</p>
                        <p>I invite you to let this anniversary be for each one of you.</p>
                        <p>In a world that so often divides people into better and worse, MASSKA has been saying something completely different for 25 years. It says that every person matters. That we do not have to be the same to be close to one another. And perhaps that is why, when I think about all these years, I do not see the stage or the spotlights first. I see faces. I see emotions. I see people who came here hoping that something beautiful would happen. And I hope they left feeling that something important had happened.</p>
                        <p>Today I would like to thank everyone who, even once, added their brick to this story. Everyone who believed it was worth it. Everyone who did not look away. Everyone who offered a hand. Everyone who created a space in which another person could feel safe, needed and special.</p>
                        <p>And if I could take only one thought from this anniversary, I would like it to be this:</p>
                        <p>We cannot always change someone's life. We cannot always take away someone's suffering, loneliness or difficulties. But we can make sure that, for a moment, someone does not feel alone. We can let them shine. And sometimes it is from just such a moment that something truly great begins.</p>
                        <p>May the stage of Teatr Atelier be, over the coming days, a place where no one has to prove that they deserve attention. May applause be not only a reward for a performance, but also an expression of respect for humanity.</p>
                        <p>And may MASSKA endure. For those who came before us. For those who are with us today. And for those who will one day cross the threshold of this stage.</p>
                        <p>Because perhaps in another 25 years someone will stand here and say that it was at MASSKA that they first felt the world had a place for them.</p>
                        <p>And then we will know it was worth it.</p>
                        <p>From the bottom of my heart, thank you for being part of this story.</p>
                    </div>
                <button type="button" class="button secondary intro-toggle" data-intro-toggle aria-expanded="false"
                    aria-controls="opening-words" data-label-more="Read the full text" data-label-less="Show less">Read the full text</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section alt" aria-labelledby="festival-schedule" data-tone="dark">
            <div class="section-inner two-column">
                <div>
                    <h2 id="festival-schedule">Festival Schedule</h2>
                    <div class="timeline">
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <h3>{edition.dateLabel.en} · In-Person Festival</h3>
                            <p>Live performances at {edition.venue.shortName} in {edition.venue.city} ({edition.venue.street}).
                                Workshops, meetings with creators, and evening events.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <h3>MASSKA Online</h3>
                            <p>Selected performances available online with Polish and English subtitles. Downloadable
                                materials and performance descriptions for audiences worldwide.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="timeline-item">
                            <h3>Hybrid Format</h3>
                            <p>Once again, we're combining the live festival experience with the global accessibility of
                                our
                                online platform, so theatre groups can reach the widest possible audience.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <aside class="info-panel" aria-label="Key festival information">
                    <h2>Key information</h2>
                    <dl>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Edition</dt>
                            <dd>{edition.numeral} · anniversary, 25 years of Masska</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Dates</dt>
                            <dd>{edition.dateLabel.en}{!edition.datesConfirmed && " (to be confirmed)"}</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Venue</dt>
                            <dd>{edition.venue.name}, {edition.venue.street}, {edition.venue.city}</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Format</dt>
                            <dd>Hybrid · Live in Sopot and globally online</dd>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <dt>Participants</dt>
                            <dd>Theatre ensembles</dd>
                        </div>
                    </dl>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="page-section alt" aria-labelledby="highlights-section">
            <div class="section-inner">
                <h2 id="highlights-section">What the festival offers</h2>
                <div class="card-grid">
                    <article class="card">
                        <img class="card__media" src="../assets/img/teatr/placeholder-1.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                        <h3>Live performances</h3>
                        <p>Performances by theatre ensembles from Poland and abroad on stages in Sopot.</p>
                        <a class="button ghost" href="program.html">View schedule</a>
                    </article>
                    <article class="card">
                        <img class="card__media" src="../assets/img/teatr/placeholder-3.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                        <h3>Online streaming</h3>
                        <p>Selected performances available online with subtitles in two
                            languages.</p>
                        <a class="button ghost" href="online.html">Online platform</a>
                    </article>
                    <article class="card">
                        <img class="card__media" src="../assets/img/teatr/placeholder-4.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
                        <h3>Workshops and meetings</h3>
                        <p>Dance, theatre, and music workshops led by professionals. Meetings with performance creators.
                        </p>
                        <a class="button ghost" href="program.html#detailed-program">Details</a>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <PosterGallery lang="en" />

        <section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="promotional-video">
            <div class="section-inner section-narrow">
                <h2 id="promotional-video">MASSKA 2025 Promotional Video</h2>
                <p>A look back at last year's XXIV edition. The anniversary trailer is coming soon.</p>
                <div>
                    <div class="external-media" data-yt-id="RbvAPtKZB9s" data-title="MASSKA 2025 - Promotional video"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
</BaseLayout>
